                   Please zoom in / out and click on the map to select an area, or choose the name of the area.
				   The statistical tables for the selected area will be displayed below the map.
                </p>
                <div class="DPContent">
                    <div id="DPtabs" class="d-lg-block">
                        <ul class="row g-0 align-items-end DPtabs-fix">
